  "sections": {
   "install": {
    "title": "Quick start",
    "html": "<p>Several quick start options are available:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/archive/v6.0.0-alpha.2.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Download the latest release</a></li>\n<li>Clone the repo: <code>git clone https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap.git</code></li>\n<li>Install with <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">npm</a>: <code>npm install bootstrap@6.0.0-alpha.2</code></li>\n<li>Install with <a href=\"https://yarnpkg.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">yarn</a>: <code>yarn add bootstrap@6.0.0-alpha.2</code></li>\n<li>Install with <a href=\"https://bun.sh/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bun</a>: <code>bun add bootstrap@6.0.0-alpha.2</code></li>\n<li>Install with <a href=\"https://getcomposer.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Composer</a>: <code>composer require twbs/bootstrap:6.0.0-alpha.2</code></li>\n<li>Install with <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NuGet</a>: CSS: <code>Install-Package bootstrap</code> Sass: <code>Install-Package bootstrap.sass</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Read the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Getting started page</a> for information on the framework contents, templates, examples, and more.</p>",
